{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05333","headline":"奉和幸望春宫送朔方大总管张仁亶 · 郑愔","name":"奉和幸望春宫送朔方大总管张仁亶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御跸下都门，军麾出塞垣。\n长杨跨武骑，细柳接戎轩。\n睿曲风云动，边威鼓吹喧。\n坐帷将阃外，俱是报明恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}